      "unsupported/child catalog roots and nested factories cannot reschedule a full volley; replay is not recursive",
      "native target copy/refcount atomics and descriptor release balance flagged counters, including replacing a newly selected enemy with original untargeted aim",
      "failed creation, owner loss, and changed expedition context discard retained references",
      "native network enqueue branch retained; peer transport is not simulated",
      "all 11 group effects replay dedicated area IDs at the captured position with empty/multiple original targets and a dead enemy lock",
      "group replays retain no enemy target reference; source/weapon context references balance",
      "personal heal, control bullets, held channels, and generated area IDs do not schedule echoes",
      "all 26 native Bullet references of the nine explicitly excluded spells emit once with balanced references and no delayed or immediate duplicate; meteor support is withdrawn",
      "installed group parameter readback retains native ally amounts, modifiers, radii and category rules; enables self and independent hit records",
      "native pose resolver uses captured world matrix for replay instead of current catalyst dummy; first emission flags remain unchanged",
      "all 215 catalog roots with native Magic=-1 replay exactly once while preserving that sentinel; auxiliary, child, excluded, behavioral, foreign-owner and explicit mismatched-Magic emissions are rejected",
      "temporary Auto-Target reference becoming invalid does not cancel root replay; original target descriptors remain available to native homing",
      "compiled initializer detour executes real 343CB0 and preserves both target-index and stack-passed shot-index ABI; actual per-shot 3x4 matrices are captured only after successful native allocation",
      "two volley indices retain independent launch matrices across current-aim changes and source-group completion; replay group generation mismatch passes through untouched",
      "compiled native group-finish detour releases matrix bindings; owner changes clear bindings; no engine calls occur under the state lock",
      "native Auto-Target roots with descriptor+90 nonzero are accepted; only delayed copies clear the borrowed context, original input is untouched, and resolved targets plus actual launch matrices remain retained",
      "Beast Claw and Gurranq Beast Claw use the standard 0.5-second delay; roots sharing an original volley share one fresh replay volley; native 52D590/52DB50/52D660 prove a consumed original does not block replay and replay still rejects a second root after its first accepted hit",
      "volley references balance on replay, owner loss, failed root creation and failed native volley allocation; original volley data is never reset",
      "normal Comet costs 70 and charged Comet costs 92; final native modifiers are applied before doubling",
      "only local owned sorcery/incantation costs double; foreign actor, ownerless, inactive, null row, non-spell and non-positive costs pass through",
      "volatile GPR/XMM and nonvolatile frame/weapon/mode registers survive the compiled mid-function hook",
